  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1473063/description_62708c62-327a-4e41-8125-e3315fd5e8da.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"467\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>陨石科技 - APX</strong></span></h1>\n<p>正式版现已正式发布，目前已包含一套完整的角色。未来将更新近10种枪械和配件……以及各种技能配件。</p>\n<p>欢迎对制作该模组包提出您的建议，未来的枪械更新也可以根据您的评论和示例进行调整。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">目前军火库中包含14种枪械和24种武器附件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">在接下来的时间里，作者将更新《泰坦陨落2》和《Apex英雄》中的所有武器和附件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">但在此之前，希望大家能给予支持。正是大家的支持有助于加快更新进度，感谢每一位参与和支持的朋友。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>安装教程</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TaCZ] 永恒经典零式 - Minecraft模组 - CurseForge</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.首先必须安装版本为1.1.5+的TaCZ模组并重启游戏一次。2.打开游戏目录，找到tacz文件夹，将下载的武器包放入其中（无需解压）。然后，重启游戏即可！</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>武器展示</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1473063/description_064233fa-084c-4593-8d24-041a1f5eadfd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"169\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1473063/description_fba1e3ce-42bc-40e3-a0ea-c5e36d24f67b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1473063/description_53142d68-bcbc-4c94-a8ec-7e1ca1c1ac27.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"169\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1473063/description_f384ec29-33fe-4bd4-aa0f-77da6b4a54d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.ne