&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>支持作者</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果您也喜欢我的武器包，可以在以下网站支持我，您可以第一时间体验最新版本以及额外内容。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">目前在网页上发布的版本是不带配件的版本。如果您想要完整版本，请支持<span style=\"color:#fff\">爱发电</span>以获取。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fmctranny88888\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.com/a/mctranny88888</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>武器包展示视频</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f382951407%253fspm_id_from%253d333.40164.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://space.bilibili.com/382951407?spm_id_from=333.40164.0.0</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">再次希望得到大家的支持和点赞！</p>",
